LuV

Purpose

LuV is the sixth major electrical tier of the progression.

This stage represents the transition from extreme industrial production into high-energy industrial infrastructure.

LuV introduces highly advanced materials, extremely demanding power requirements, complex multi-stage processing, and large interconnected production systems.

The objective of LuV is to make the industrial infrastructure itself a major part of progression.

