Power

LuV introduces a major increase in energy requirements.

Power generation must operate at extremely high capacity.

Electrical distribution must support multiple high-consumption machines operating simultaneously.

Power infrastructure must be designed around industrial-scale factories rather than individual machines.

Energy storage and power stabilization become increasingly important.

Running a LuV factory should require meaningful investment in electrical infrastructure.

