Modern Industrialization Integration

Modern Industrialization acts as a complementary industrial system.

MI can provide additional processing capabilities and machines for LuV production.

MI materials and machinery must follow the established LuV progression.

MI must not provide an easier route around GregTech's LuV requirements.

Mekanism Integration

Mekanism provides advanced processing, chemistry, refining, and supporting infrastructure.

Its systems can be used to increase industrial throughput and support large factories.

Mekanism resources and machines must remain integrated with the main progression.

Mekanism must not allow access to higher tiers without completing the required LuV progression.

