Exit Condition

LuV is completed when the player has established a stable high-energy industrial complex.

LuV production must be heavily automated.

Major LuV materials must have reliable production.

Important LuV components must be produced automatically.

Advanced chemical and material processing must be integrated into the factory.

Power generation and distribution must support continuous LuV production.

The player must be able to produce the components required for ZPM.

After these requirements are fulfilled, ZPM is unlocked.

The ultimate goal of LuV is to establish the industrial infrastructure necessary to support the transition into the highest levels of technological progression.
